                                <TextBlock Text="隱私權政策、服務條款、第三方軟體授權清單等，見左側「法律」分類" Style="{StaticResource SettingRowSubtitleStyle}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>

                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource BaseTextStyle}" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                            <Run Text="工作區 ID：" /><Run Text="{Binding ActiveWorkspaceId, Mode=OneWay}" />
